{
  "slug": "claude-cursor-orchestration",
  "name": "Claude Cursor Orchestration",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code + Cursor Agent orchestration system. Delegates coding tasks to Cursor Agent via ACP bridge with Phase 0-8 pipeline.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `app-development` (App Development Orchestrator - delegates coding to Cursor Agent) and **1 hook**, `UserPromptSubmit`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-cursor-orchestration@claude-community` from `ax-inc-dev/claude-cursor-orchestration`.\n\nClaude Code をオーケストレーター、Cursor Agent を実装ワーカーとして連携させるエージェントオーケストレーションシステム",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
